Methodology segmentation rules

Usage: vendo measurement rules [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  preview  Preview which segmentation rule fires for recent rows
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help
